# scripts/opcount: `vt replay` reads a terminal stream on stdin, parses it,
# plays it on a 24x80 screen with 1 MiB of history and prints the screen.
# The input is `vt gen 7 N`, N bytes of shell-like output; the cost of one
# input byte is the slope between the two sizes (DT4's receipt).
unit byte
sizes 2000000 16000000
input self gen 7 {n}
args replay
control cmd/ergo/testdata/vt/control
